{
  "_comment": [
    "IR agent Datadog dashboard, applied by Apply-DatadogConfig.ps1 via",
    "POST /api/v1/dashboard (create) and PUT /api/v1/dashboard/{id} (update).",
    "https://docs.datadoghq.com/api/latest/dashboards/",
    "",
    "_datadog_id pins the live board this file owns. Two dashboards are named",
    "for the IR agent (abc-050-def is the dev copy titled 'IR Agent -",
    "Observability'; yyy-040-zzz is this test board, which the user renamed by",
    "hand to 'Internal -IR Agent - Observability'), so a title lookup cannot",
    "identify the right one. Verified live 2026-08-26.",
    "",
    "PRESERVED FROM THE USER'S MANUAL EDITS to yyy-040-zzz (read live",
    "2026-08-26, modified_at 2026-08-26T13:31:20 CDT):",
    "  - the hand-edited title 'Internal -IR Agent - Observability'",
    "  - both template variables, in the singular `default` form the live",
    "    board uses (env=test, ml_app=ir-agent)",
    "reflow_type is changed from auto to fixed on purpose: fixed is what lets",
    "each widget carry an explicit x/y/w/h, which is the only way to guarantee",
    "the header band stays on ONE row directly under the time selector. Same",
    "mechanism the reference board ghi-060-jkl uses.",
    "",
    "LAYOUT reference: https://us5.datadoghq.com/dashboard/ghi-060-jkl",
    "Matched materially: ordered + fixed reflow, no widget groups, a single",
    "12-column rollup band at y=0, then full-width tables, then paired",
    "half-width charts. Its tags and metrics are CodeAgent's and are not copied.",
    "",
    "THREE DATA STORES, AND A QUERY AGAINST THE WRONG ONE RETURNS AN EMPTY",
    "WIDGET RATHER THAN AN ERROR:",
    "  bifrost.*   env, virtual_key_name. Real billed money. Nothing about",
    "              incidents or sub-agents.",
    "  ml_obs.*    env, error, ml_app, model_name, model_provider, service,",
    "              span_kind (+ source on cost metrics). No per-run, per-tool",
    "              or per-sub-agent dimension. Cost is NANODOLLARS.",
    "  APM spans   service, env, operation_name, resource_name and the custom",
    "              iragent.* tags. NOT ml_app, NOT span_kind, NOT @evaluation.*.",
    "  ir_agent.*  span-based metrics from spans_metrics_ir_agent.json. Only",
    "              the tags their own group_by declares, plus env. No ml_app.",
    "Never mix the terms in one query.",
    "",
    "Span tag prefix is lowercase iragent. -- Datadog normalizes span and",
    "metric tag keys to lowercase",
    "(https://docs.datadoghq.com/getting_started/tagging/). The @ prefix is",
    "span-attribute search syntax, not part of the tag key."
  ],
  "_datadog_id": "yyy-040-zzz",
  "title": "Internal -IR Agent - Observability",
  "description": "Single-agent observability board for the incident response agent: Bifrost billed rollups, per-sub-agent breakdown by time window and by run, and one row per investigation. Managed as JSON at incident_response_agent/observability/datadog/dashboard_ir_agent.json and applied by Apply-DatadogConfig.ps1. No longer Terraform-managed.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "fixed",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "available_values": [],
      "default": "test"
    },
    {
      "name": "ml_app",
      "prefix": "ml_app",
      "available_values": [],
      "default": "ir-agent"
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
