    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "THE TWO SUB-AGENT TABLES ABOVE NEED TWO THINGS THE AGENT DOES NOT EMIT YET.\n(1) TOOL CALLS. Verified against app/app_utils/dd_run_plugin.py on branch ado-200004: the ir.sub_agent span carries iragent.{input_tokens_est,output_tokens_est,tokens_est,cost_usd_est} and the iragent.sub_agent tag, and NOTHING ELSE. There is no tool-call counter. The 'Tool calls' column is written against a span metric named iragent.tool_calls on the ir.sub_agent span; if the shipped name differs, fix it HERE rather than substituting another metric. Do NOT fall back to ml_obs.span{span_kind:tool} -- that metric has no sub_agent dimension and would attribute every tool call to every sub-agent.\n(2) RUN IDENTITY ON THE SUB-AGENT SPAN. iragent.incident_id and iragent.invocation_id are tagged on the ROOT span only (dd_run_plugin.py annotate_root_span / persistence.py). Datadog span tags do NOT inherit from parent to child, so the SUB-AGENTS PER RUN table stays empty until both are also tagged on the ir.sub_agent span.",
        "background_color": "orange",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "top",
        "show_tick": false,
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_table",
        "title": "INVESTIGATIONS - one row per run (cost and tokens are BILLED or ABSENT)",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "has_search_bar": "auto",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "formulas": [
              {
                "alias": "Spans",
                "formula": "runs"
              },
              {
                "alias": "Tokens (billed)",
                "formula": "tokens"
              },
              {
                "alias": "Cost USD (billed)",
                "formula": "cost"
