    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "EVALUATIONS ARE NOT AVAILABLE ON THIS BOARD.\n\napp/evaluators/verification_bridge.py submits four trace-scoped labels: ir_diagnosis_quality, ir_investigation_efficiency, ir_evidence_citation_ratio, ir_investigation_reliable.\n\nVerified live 2026-08-26: ml_obs.evaluation returns ZERO series ORG-WIDE, and the APM spans index carries no @evaluation.* facet. There is no query that reaches these scores, so no widget is built for them -- an empty correctness panel reads as 'nothing failed', which is worse than an honest absence.\n\nREQUIRED TO FIX: the agent must emit the evaluations as a custom metric of its own (for example ir.evaluation.score, tagged by label and assessment). Until then the scores are real and readable only in the LLM Observability UI.",
        "background_color": "gray",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "top",
        "show_tick": false,
        "has_padding": true
